<h1 local-id=3D"d88e34e60324" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-1.ExecutiveSummary"><strong>1. Executive Summary</stro=
ng></h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"e2fd7da3e21e" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-1.1Introduction">1.1 Introduction</h2>
<p local-id=3D"dd5401fad166">This technical proposal outlines the design, a=
rchitecture, and implementation strategy for the <strong>Smart Health Check=
up Recommendation Dashboard</strong> at Navavej Hospital. The primary objec=
tive is to develop an intelligent, AI-driven platform that systematically a=
nalyzes a patient=E2=80=99s historical medical data to recommend highly acc=
urate, safe, and personalized health checkup programs. By combining interna=
tional healthcare data standards (HL7 FHIR R4) with an advanced, pluggable =
Artificial Intelligence architecture (Model-Switching Architecture), the pr=
oposed system will elevate Navavej Hospital's services to a true "Personali=
zed Medicine" approach. The solution inherently prioritizes security and pr=
ivacy, utilizing strict Data Masking, SMART on FHIR authorization, and the =
Model Context Protocol (MCP) to ensure full compliance with PDPA and HIPAA =
regulations.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"bb8f350142df" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-1.2BackgroundInformation">1.2 Background Information</=
h2>
<p local-id=3D"3a36495f4c89">Traditionally, health checkup programs are sel=
ected based on generic criteria such as age and gender. However, this gener=
alized approach frequently leads to "Screening Gaps"=E2=80=94missed opportu=
nities to identify hidden health risks or prioritize critical preventative =
care. Service recipients possess rich, longitudinal medical histories store=
d within the Navavej Hospital Information System (HIS / IQVIA SaaS), encomp=
assing diagnoses, lab value velocities, biomarker trends (e.g., eGFR slope =
or BMI), and historical screening data.</p>
<p local-id=3D"1da6349b278b">To bridge the gap between this wealth of raw d=
ata and actionable clinical insights, Navavej requires a system capable of =
interpreting complex medical histories efficiently and securely. This entai=
ls moving away from manual, ad-hoc program selection toward a <strong>Hybri=
d Recommendation Engine (Rule-based combined with AI)</strong>. The core ch=
allenge to realizing this vision is not only generating medically accurate =
recommendations but also standardizing the legacy data using international =
clinical code mapping (LOINC, SNOMED CT, ICD-10) and strictly safeguarding =
patient privacy before any data interacts with external AI models. This pro=
posal presents a modular, highly secure technical blueprint designed specif=
ically to leapfrog these challenges, while supporting seamless future AI up=
grades without core system disruptions.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"81288bd4923b" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-1.3To-BeVision&amp;CoreValueProposition">1.3 To-Be Vis=
ion &amp; Core Value Proposition</h2><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-fil=
e-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=
=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"navavej-to-be.jpeg" widt=
h=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"0a8526d641cd0834347adc510869431ade87ce9d6=
6b643f44a08d5fa02529c01" data-image-src=3D"https://vns-site.atlassian.net/w=
iki/download/attachments/237994005/navavej-to-be.jpeg?version=3D1&amp;modif=
icationDate=3D1773982197403&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=
=3D"1536" data-width=3D"2752" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-link=
ed-resource-id=3D"238223418" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked=
-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"navavej=
-to-be.jpeg" data-base-url=3D"https://vns-site.atlassian.net/wiki" data-lin=
ked-resource-content-type=3D"image/jpeg" data-linked-resource-container-id=
=3D"237994005" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"65" data-media-id=
=3D"c1d3e4a1-4026-4b7d-9c48-f125a554f8b3" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"261"></span>
<p local-id=3D"ab166da568b2">The "To-Be" vision is a fully automated, trans=
parent, and standardized workflow where raw clinical data transforms into h=
ighly personalized patient care without compromising a single data privacy =
boundary. The core value propositions of this platform are:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"cda5ef9e-a98f-42dc-ae3e-79633c1b3913">
<li local-id=3D"c62f18e2-2b84-45cb-ac8e-ac1b18d59600">
<p local-id=3D"03577aadcdd0"><strong>Precision and Personalization:</strong=
> The system will evaluate dozens of hard clinical markers (e.g., BMI veloc=
ity, JNC 8 blood pressure categories, genetic histories) to generate custom=
ized primary and "Add-On" examination recommendations that successfully clo=
se vital Screening Gaps.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8511d075-5b04-4059-bf55-94443efc2d9b">
<p local-id=3D"058b1c9a312b"><strong>Explainable AI (XAI) for Trust:</stron=
g> Both healthcare providers and service recipients will receive clear, log=
ical reasoning behind every AI recommendation alongside a Confidence Score,=
 completely eliminating "black-box" medical uncertainty.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"de0b0aec-e7ae-4224-a772-faab090f376e">
<p local-id=3D"216f155d9533"><strong>Security by Design:</strong> Applying =
the SMART on FHIR authorization standard and the strict Least Privilege Mod=
el Context Protocol (MCP) ensures that PII is masked before any inference o=
ccurs, and every AI prompt is immutably logged for comprehensive auditing.<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8ed592fb-9240-481d-a9e2-4767608e044b">
<p local-id=3D"07e8124d996a"><strong>Future-Proof Pluggable Architecture:</=
strong> Exploring a Model-Switching Central AI Gateway guarantees Navavej H=
ospital flexibility. Administrators can effortlessly transition between fro=
ntier AI models (e.g., from GPT-5 to Claude 4 or an on-premise Local Llama =
model) via configuration screens, entirely avoiding vendor lock-in as techn=
ology advances.</p></li>
</ol>
<h1 local-id=3D"7806c8c60938" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-2.ProjectScope&amp;Assumptions"><strong>2. Project Sco=
pe &amp; Assumptions</strong></h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"1a9b88eab1c6" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-2.1ScopeofWork(In-ScopeDeliverables)">2.1 Scope of Wor=
k (In-Scope Deliverables)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"11bb88601d73">The implementation of the Smart Health Checkup=
 Recommendation Dashboard encompasses the complete end-to-end delivery of t=
he data, security, AI, and presentation layers.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1297" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"7c=
2d7bd4-b695-4460-b8d5-8b481ba82354" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 310.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 987.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"13566096-ab06-4b77-917f-d75a8c40e18d">
<th data-local-id=3D"34948916-251f-44db-93fa-ca5deddf5635" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a12437dab39a"><strong>Implementation Layer</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e8ea6ffe-1d5c-4310-bd4f-97155be73e79" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f3485b046dd1"><strong>Deliverables &amp; Included Scope</str=
ong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6640f6c7-15a2-40f5-8d60-b8e980aa48c7">
<td data-local-id=3D"1f5031b9-9a70-41eb-9d28-076ba3377a3c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55e0d31f4f03"><strong>Data Integration &amp; Storage</strong=
></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"82d656e8-7fb8-4ac4-8dcb-dc9dd261673a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"182ddf15ccd6">
<li local-id=3D"ee662169fb7b">
<p local-id=3D"5fb4cea2890d">Secure data extraction from Navavej HIS (IQVIA=
 SaaS) via CDC sync.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8c022506e1f4">
<p local-id=3D"4e357e8cdd21">Automated processing and terminology mapping i=
nto international clinical codes (LOINC, SNOMED CT, ICD-10).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"350575345256">
<p local-id=3D"b065c5252fad">Setup of the dual-storage architecture: Core <=
strong>FHIR Database</strong> &amp; analytical <strong>Trending Store DB</s=
trong>.</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ac2fa929-bae7-49af-8e0c-63fe42eef156">
<td data-local-id=3D"be7329ae-4653-4a6a-b659-d2898a54b226" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"90061c27e9c6"><strong>AI Recommendation Engine</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"77b916f1-7220-4a94-8810-5d00166f3210" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"3dbbd0e442aa">
<li local-id=3D"4648b9b9b7de">
<p local-id=3D"349e849decb2">Development of the <strong>Hybrid Recommendati=
on Engine</strong> combining hard medical rules with AI logic.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c9f64d3f5c13">
<p local-id=3D"68fe6f699528">Delivery of the Central <strong>AI Gateway</st=
rong> supporting pluggable, model-switching architecture.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7ec3e1b7358">
<p local-id=3D"650e57b12f47">Implementation of the <strong>Model Context Pr=
otocol (MCP) Server</strong> for secure context retrieval.</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1e4f3ad0-81a1-4532-8475-21ec03dc105c">
<td data-local-id=3D"34013241-65da-4485-8964-133d59115acd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b14970dcf590"><strong>Security &amp; Compliance</strong></p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17906e18-3fd1-4b6b-a578-e7be6a2a9a8e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"49bdf84bb6b6">
<li local-id=3D"ce00f7f4be7f">
<p local-id=3D"d0c944ab78b0"><strong>SMART on FHIR</strong> authorization s=
erver acting as the gateway for all FHIR data.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9cb782c3299c">
<p local-id=3D"90a1194116ea">Strict <strong>Data Masking</strong> protocol =
within the MCP layer to eliminate PII leakage to the AI.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7acdfcb8b14c">
<p local-id=3D"adf8d2d00a21">Implementation of the immutable <strong>5-Dime=
nsion Audit Log</strong> (Who, When, Where, What, Why).</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3143e666-debe-49ac-84de-cc4fff978af7">
<td data-local-id=3D"138638c4-bf11-4048-8e2a-8f32943b5f4a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fdd69a2a542c"><strong>User Interfaces (Web)</strong></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"7655315e-42a4-4b1e-a8b8-40cf611e0b02" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"2dc699a8d5c5">
<li local-id=3D"ccca3af69de0">
<p local-id=3D"5a7302aa6263"><strong>Healthcare Provider Dashboard:</strong=
> Screens displaying Individual Summaries, historical Trend Timelines (3-5 =
years), Screening Gaps, and Explainable AI reasoning.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1015ba8b565f">
<p local-id=3D"4d9f638f33bb"><strong>Admin/DPO Dashboard:</strong> Screens =
for Real-Time Access Monitoring and Behavior Anomaly Detection.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b703e6ee16b0">
<p local-id=3D"e73efeaa7ccf"><strong>Management team:</strong> Conversion t=
racking and business performance dashboard.</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ea9612ce-6533-42e3-b8a2-ad0777730039">
<td data-local-id=3D"10afcd4b-5bb0-420b-87fe-508779471fb1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc37b13a1c7e"><strong>Testing &amp; Deployment</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b1f71f5a-a308-4a30-90d7-1d93e5878ab0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<ul local-id=3D"00d268c71349">
<li local-id=3D"51319cb023f4">
<p local-id=3D"5dbe646e1e91">Complete system containerization (Docker/Micro=
services).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7693c34f0753">
<p local-id=3D"1e5266fbefd5"><strong>Medical Acceptance Testing (MAT)</stro=
ng> to ensure the AI hits the &gt; 95% threshold of expert consensus.</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"cee6133383e9">
<p local-id=3D"00ef1c9de4f8">Performance testing to ensure strict SLA compl=
iance (&lt; 10-second latency).</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"e1578b9267b0" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-2.2OutofScope">2.2 Out of Scope</h2>
<p local-id=3D"ae4d95dcc1c6">To ensure strict project boundaries and focus,=
 the following items are excluded from this implementation phase:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1715" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"cc=
71cdea-7cfe-4563-a311-ca553b835700" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 354.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1359.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f7a4cb5c-43de-4fe6-8ae0-f80726d55302">
<th data-local-id=3D"91aefd1e-0023-4454-b9ec-bf7ac9ad73f1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b48b1769d177"><strong>Out-of-Scope Area</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c9852e8e-8e29-4f80-bb18-69fca5c93931" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"565a151d8ba5"><strong>Description</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b3976f51-2436-4a6c-b485-c49e2a076a18">
<td data-local-id=3D"141e56ce-12b9-4594-9df2-281d1ffc8c69" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"225654d402b2"><strong>Legacy HIS Replacement</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"a22b98f7-a2f2-49a0-bf4e-86ad4ae9dabf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e11eaf1706fa">The proposed solution acts as an intelligent a=
dd-on. It does not replace, refactor, or migrate the core functionality of =
the existing Navavej Hospital Information System (IQVIA).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"61aa6890-ffd5-4c29-a073-e806ce5d0941">
<td data-local-id=3D"35b53339-5c51-4f66-8b46-be1e7d671b6f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e961212cac2c"><strong>Bi-Directional EMR Writes</strong></p>=
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d389d813-4901-494a-aa2e-1b1b03047353" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e36154fd130e">The AI operates purely in a read-only state vi=
a the MCP server to deduce recommendations. It will not autonomously write =
back to or alter the core medical records in the HIS.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0093adec-104f-4dd6-b5d2-9b9b4bca6c28">
<td data-local-id=3D"34ab7554-7da3-41a6-8147-9a24fd44c818" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3d24fd8e0521"><strong>Financial / Billing AI</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"b44a6218-06f7-4ac3-ae13-af1504aa08d0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c29a3407f81">The AI scope is strictly limited to medical he=
alth checkup recommendations. Predictive models for hospital financial fore=
casting or billing are excluded.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fa71415b-f362-498a-bb04-46a5cad258ef">
<td data-local-id=3D"3b8fc469-07b5-4c25-ac1b-0fe53a7302f7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f3b5169c0219"><strong>Physical Hardware</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5932635-9716-4a94-a65c-3ea3f9b1de12" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0a551c9ecf5d">Procurement, delivery, or maintenance of physi=
cal on-premise hardware servers is excluded (presuming standard cloud infra=
structure usage).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"d7246f044550" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-2.3KeyAssumptions&amp;Dependencies">2.3 Key Assumption=
s &amp; Dependencies</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2bdf0e5188ee">The successful delivery of this architecture r=
elies on the following baseline assumptions:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1715" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"9d=
029af0-8487-4ac5-8760-9395c6d73293" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 382.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1332.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"abe8cc81-c09a-4422-be73-dbc8cbfb2156">
<th data-local-id=3D"097f87eb-cb17-4e12-9ace-d65611846eec" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fbe8c80df488"><strong>Dependency Domain</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"195e0765-b44a-40bc-b028-8cee9088b774" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e79e80b48db1"><strong>Assumption Statement</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e925c73f-0290-473f-b656-8f4dc2f2fd5e">
<td data-local-id=3D"a95b5834-f93c-4233-9362-2ef4957d2682" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e3bd23ec2d15"><strong>Data Availability</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"811ae3f1-866e-4350-a4c6-b967a5be2914" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8cbc8d463430">The existing Navavej HIS (IQVIA SaaS) supports=
 and permits reliable, near-real-time data synchronization (e.g., CDC or ro=
bust APIs) necessary to populate the pipeline.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"53168184-9cab-4b24-8965-5ffcb0231caf">
<td data-local-id=3D"c9391a15-32b5-4fbb-bd0e-5a442bf9acea" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e33b45c792f2"><strong>Medical Ruleset Support</strong></p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"08b21df8-9765-404c-bc02-7894ccc779ad" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a413566fbc71">Clinical experts at Navavej will provide the d=
efinitive "Safety Rules" (e.g., age limits, gender-specific checks) require=
d to train and constrain the rule-based safety engine.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ea741469-54e4-4508-9056-d4a450d92c4c">
<td data-local-id=3D"d16444d8-a564-4148-865b-f418ab0a6766" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d21cf775eb6d"><strong>LLM Infrastructure</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d0decfee-dc8f-489d-be00-6c0aac172048" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ec6ea77a8fdf">Commercial LLM API accounts (such as OpenAI/An=
thropic) or provisioned local GPU hardware (if utilizing a localized LLM) w=
ill be funded or provided by the hospital.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
