       =20
        Pipeline["=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F Data Integration Pipeline&lt;br&gt;[Cl=
eansing, SNOMED Mapping,&lt;br&gt;Pre-Masking, Pre-Computing]"]
       =20
        FHIR[("=F0=9F=8F=A5 Core FHIR Database&lt;br&gt;[HL7 R4 Standards]"=
)]
        MaskedFHIR[("=F0=9F=94=92 Masked FHIR Schema&lt;br&gt;[Pre-Masked C=
linical Data]")]
        Trend[("=F0=9F=93=88 Trending Store DB&lt;br&gt;[AI Feature Store]"=
)]
        AuditDB[("=F0=9F=93=9C Audit DB&lt;br&gt;[Immutable 5-D Logs]")]
       =20
        RecEngine["=F0=9F=A7=A0 Hybrid Recommendation Engine&lt;br&gt;[Medi=
cal Safety Rules + AI Logic]"]
        AIGateway["=F0=9F=9A=AA Central AI Gateway&lt;br&gt;[Model Config &=
amp; Audit Logging]"]
        MCP["=F0=9F=9B=A1=EF=B8=8F MCP Server&lt;br&gt;[Read-Only Data Fetc=
her]"]
        BIEngine["=F0=9F=93=8A BI Engine&lt;br&gt;[Conversion Tracking &amp=
;&lt;br&gt;Executive Dashboards]"]
    end

    %% Actor Relationships
    Provider --&gt;|Uses Dashboard &amp;&lt;br&gt;Captures Conversion| WebA=
pp
    Management --&gt;|Views BI &amp;&lt;br&gt;Executive Dashboard| WebApp
    DPO --&gt;|Monitors Access&lt;br&gt;&amp; Manages Config| WebApp
    WebApp --&gt;|Authenticates via| Auth
    WebApp --&gt;|Requests recommendations| RecEngine
    WebApp --&gt;|Queries BI metrics| BIEngine
   =20
    %% Data Ingestion
    HIS --&gt;|CDC Sync / Stream raw data| Pipeline
    Pipeline --&gt;|Writes standardized R4 data| FHIR
    Pipeline --&gt;|Writes pre-masked data| MaskedFHIR
    Pipeline --&gt;|Writes AI features| Trend
   =20
    Auth -.- |Secures Access to DBs| FHIR
   =20
    %% AI Workflow
    RecEngine --&gt;|Initiates AI Workflow| AIGateway
    AIGateway --&gt;|Requests Context via Tools| MCP
   =20
    MCP --&gt;|Authenticates as Client| Auth
    MCP --&gt;|Reads masked clinical data| MaskedFHIR
    MCP --&gt;|Reads analytic trends| Trend
   =20
    AIGateway --&gt;|Sends masked prompt &amp;&lt;br&gt;receives inference|=
 LLM
    AIGateway --&gt;|Writes audit trail| AuditDB
   =20
    %% BI / Conversion
    BIEngine --&gt;|Reads recommendation logs| AuditDB
    BillingCRM --&gt;|Transaction data&lt;br&gt;(API / CDC)| BIEngine</pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"19a2984e1770" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-3.3CoreModulesOverview">3.3 Core Modules Overview</h2>
<p local-id=3D"9fdf8be43d28">To realize the "To-Be" architecture, the syste=
m is logically divided into 7 specialized, decoupled microservice modules:<=
/p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"2b3b3fa7-219b-49aa-9007-a1093fa4a1b7">
<li local-id=3D"4eb6a4d7-24f9-4aff-b925-e3e742fe3ff7">
<p local-id=3D"de86f430e4fd"><strong>Web Dashboard (Frontend UI):</strong> =
A responsive application (e.g., React/Next.js) serving 2 primary user group=
s. It provides:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"641ac48282f4">
<li local-id=3D"e72d6e90b41b">
<p local-id=3D"19b9561a912f">Sales/Doctors: with the <strong>Individual Sum=
mary</strong> and <strong>Trend Timelines</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"33a297eaf17b">
<p local-id=3D"38872cd3cb22">DPO: with an <strong>Access Monitoring</strong=
> page for anomaly detection.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"719452d3-a87f-4572-b1a6-aaeb8348ffb3">
<p local-id=3D"844b6b68f581"><strong>Data Integration Pipeline:</strong> A =
robust ETL engine that captures updates from the Navavej HIS via CDC sync. =
It handles data cleansing, strict clinical code mapping (LOINC, SNOMED CT, =
ICD-10), and the pre-computation of complex health trends (e.g., eGFR slope=
 or BMI velocity).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"43af6994-bb4e-4034-b53b-098228d0c893">
<p local-id=3D"8037f308220e"><strong>Dual-Storage Databases:</strong> The d=
ata storage layer is deliberately split. The <strong>Core FHIR DB</strong> =
maintains immutable, standardized clinical records, while the <strong>Trend=
ing Store DB</strong> acts as a flexible AI Feature Store for pre-computed =
longitudinal data.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d5e79aea-25f4-4e03-af21-f76630f57e96">
<p local-id=3D"802ee724cbbd"><strong>SMART on FHIR Authorization Server:</s=
trong> The centralized OAuth 2.0 gatekeeper. It ensures that every request =
pulling from the databases=E2=80=94whether requested by a doctor's dashboar=
d or the MCP context fetcher=E2=80=94operates under strict, resource-level =
scopes.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"26f0f52c-ad5b-4dd4-af1c-51ea6641934e">
<p local-id=3D"b5c7f8d2acd6"><strong>Hybrid Recommendation Engine:</strong>=
 The orchestrator of the system's clinical logic. It applies deterministic =
"Safety Rules" (e.g., specific age/gender limits) <em>before and after</em>=
 invoking the AI, ensuring medical safety acts as a fail-safe parachute alo=
ngside the statistical AI model.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"795f2019-24fb-4615-bf55-19bfc04d0971">
<p local-id=3D"1871f374ca82"><strong>Model Context Protocol (MCP) Middlewar=
e:</strong> A specialized, Read-Only data fetcher. It serves as the ultimat=
e privacy filter, pulling records from the FHIR and Trending databases and =
strictly scrubbing all Personally Identifiable Information (PII) before the=
 context is ever shared with the AI.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"327b9a4e-de10-4e1d-8a57-1affc87af2b9">
<p local-id=3D"bb48b5868d0b"><strong>AI Gateway &amp; Pluggable Models:</st=
rong> A model-agnostic API router that bridges the masked context to fronti=
er LLMs (e.g., GPT-4, Claude 3.5, Local Llama). Crucially, this module is a=
lso responsible for executing the immutable 5-Dimension Audit Logging (Who,=
 When, Where, What, Why) for every single AI inference execution.</p></li>
</ol>
<h1 local-id=3D"6035937bee44" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-4.DataPlatform&amp;IntegrationArchitecture"><strong>4.=
 Data Platform &amp; Integration Architecture</strong></h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"55c0b55d7e5e" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-4.1High-levelDataPlatformArchitecture">4.1 High-level =
Data Platform Architecture</h2><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrap=
per image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"nvv-data-platform-overview.jpeg=
" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"6b6d7c44c8ce181db726e75975bb4214286=
