d>
<td data-local-id=3D"50af1c34b792" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7e6feba7b627">Amazon API Gateway, Amazon Cognito (OAuth 2.0 =
/ RBAC), AWS KMS for encryption.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"12db4d9d270c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"abe5284d951f">Kong / KrakenD API Gateway, Keycloak for Ident=
ity/OAuth, and HashiCorp Vault for secure vaults and re-identification.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
