text sent to the LLM, with PII removed), <code>ai_response</code>, <code>mo=
del_id</code>, <code>latency_ms</code>, <code>safety_conflict_events</code>=
</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e749d2a2-972d-488e-9b30-7c41d1ab591d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b24c961db46f">The complete transaction record of what was se=
nt to the AI and what it returned. All patient-identifiable fields are <str=
ong>scrubbed before inference</strong> =E2=80=94 no PII reaches the AI or t=
his log in any form</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ad58bb4b-a367-4de5-839b-1b08f56c61ae">
