: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">flowcha=
rt TD
    A[Phase 1: Parallel MCP Fetch&lt;br&gt;get_hard_constraints&lt;br&gt;ge=
t_clinical_signals&lt;br&gt;get_biomarker_trends&lt;br&gt;get_program_rules=
et]
    A --&gt; B{Context&lt;br&gt;Sufficient?}
    B -- Yes: Optimization Path --&gt; D
    B -- No: ReAct Path --&gt; C[Additional Targeted&lt;br&gt;MCP Tool Call=
s&lt;br&gt;bounded iteration cap]
    C --&gt; D[Phase 2: Rule Evaluation&lt;br&gt;+ Agent 1: AnalyzeClinical=
Risks]
    D -- Agent 1 fails --&gt; FB[Rule-Based Output&lt;br&gt;recommendation_=
source: RuleBased&lt;br&gt;review_required: true]
    D --&gt; E[Phase 3: Parallel Agents&lt;br&gt;Agent 2a: MatchPolicy&lt;b=
r&gt;Agent 2b: WriteNarrative]
    E -- Both agents fail --&gt; FB
