    E -- Agent 2b fails only --&gt; PF2[Narrative from Agent 1&lt;br&gt;cli=
nical_summary_bullets]
    PF1 --&gt; F
    PF2 --&gt; F
    E --&gt; F[Phase 4: Safety Validation&lt;br&gt;=E2=86=92 Audit Log&lt;b=
