<h3 local-id=3D"6c8411a62d95" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-7.2.2DesignConstraints">7.2.2 Design Constraints</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"bafae704-be64-479c-8004-9b6b37933691">
<li local-id=3D"9ee55941-7b4a-476c-b8b3-b1669956f6d5">
<p local-id=3D"1fa78e8fcf4c">All tools are <strong>read-only</strong> =E2=
=80=94 no tool writes to or modifies any clinical data store.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7b75db46-e78f-40c2-972d-c8791c15473c">
<p local-id=3D"0b1a4beb0db5">Tool calls are <strong>single-patient-scoped</=
strong> =E2=80=94 each call retrieves data for exactly one patient.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"9281516a-03af-47e4-8af1-6db6d1714389">
<p local-id=3D"e75a4b4fd2ce">The four AI-facing tools are called <strong>in=
 parallel</strong> during Phase 1 of the workflow (see =C2=A77.1), with no =
ordering dependency between them.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"693e487b-d4e8-49a2-b12a-c404e4d5ba64">
<p local-id=3D"61577f038669"><code>get_patient_event_timeline</code> is cal=
led separately by the UI layer and is excluded from the AI context assembly=
.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"8a01157b7741" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-7.3HybridRecommendationLogic(Rule-basedSafety+AIInfere=
nce)">7.3 Hybrid Recommendation Logic (Rule-based Safety + AI Inference)</h=
2>
<p local-id=3D"1a0a1bb33a9a">The recommendation engine uses a three-layer d=
ecision architecture that combines deterministic clinical rules with AI-dri=
ven contextual reasoning. Each layer has a fixed responsibility; the orderi=
ng ensures that AI judgement is always grounded in rule-computed clinical c=
ontext and then checked by a final deterministic safety pass before any rec=
ommendation reaches a physician.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"307a22489e8f" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-7.3.1Three-LayerArchitecture">7.3.1 Three-Layer Archit=
ecture</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5c0fd25c4729"><strong>Layer 1 =E2=80=94 Deterministic Rule T=
ier (pre-AI)</strong> The <code>RuleEvaluator</code> processes the patient'=
s active clinical signals and maps them to a recommendation tier using an a=
dmin-configurable rule set. Rules are evaluated in priority order; the firs=
t matching rule determines the tier. This tier serves as the anchor value p=
assed to Layer 2.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9aa62e21ca3c"><strong>Layer 2 =E2=80=94 AI-Driven Tier and A=
dd-On Selection (Agent 2a)</strong> Agent 2a (<code>MatchPolicy</code>) rec=
eives both the assembled clinical context and the rule-computed preliminary=
 tier. It selects the final tier and recommends specific add-on items. If t=
he AI selects a tier that differs from the rule-computed anchor, it must pr=
ovide a written <code>tier_deviation_justification</code> =E2=80=94 this fi=
eld is mandatory and non-nullable when a deviation occurs, ensuring that ev=
ery AI override is explicitly reasoned and auditable.</p>
<p local-id=3D"add1d0466e53"><strong>Layer 3 =E2=80=94 Post-AI Safety Filte=
r (deterministic)</strong> <code>SafetyRuleValidator</code> applies determi=
nistic eligibility checks against the AI-recommended add-ons. Any add-on th=
at fails a gender, age, or contraindication constraint is silently removed =
from the final list. Each removal is logged as a <code>safety_conflict_even=
t</code> in the audit record. This layer cannot be overridden by AI output.=
</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"3e4dcc4e933d" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-TierSelectionRules">Tier Selection Rules</h4>
<p local-id=3D"06190623d3eb">Rules are evaluated in priority order. The fir=
st matching rule is applied.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1104" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"69=
3e1381-1102-496a-a895-48a2fe1aed69" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 81.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 239.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 106.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 207.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 468.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"afc6806c-cfa4-4f0d-ace0-cce665a1bab8">
<th data-local-id=3D"9cb12bd7-d192-472a-a8ba-1f4d1ea6f0e1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fd332aceedde">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"0135726d-26ff-495a-bc73-a1516e5fd3dd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0237a4498952">Rule ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"5720828f-9a8c-4cd8-9b46-c02a5dbf4386" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"da78d39d5572">Tier</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d26218da-d430-4556-b4ae-f78ce34c4006" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"637485992689">Match Logic</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"79dde52f-0244-45a9-b2b5-e8b9e2ba9c7a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b8f40ff6b85e">Trigger Condition</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"98c32026-078c-451f-b282-02b84482f19c">
<td data-local-id=3D"301ac383-9111-44c1-bf2b-92ffd4f0fd83" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"33fc72dfdc14">1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c2f34ffe-4630-40f6-b902-0b2f23f3f69a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6de1a79a36a0"><code>PREMIUM_SEVERE_SINGLE</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"08c59726-b662-4954-a50e-21d832a21d61" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6547a48572bc">Premium</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"82c448f4-5225-4390-adbb-d25a5606b63d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"443b353b8456">Any single severe indicator</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ab3f8b5f-bc7c-45e8-b2ad-5ec958a149bc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f1e147f1ab3">eGFR annual decline &gt; 5 mL/min/1.73m=C2=B2,=
 ASCVD 10-yr risk =E2=89=A5 20%, hypertensive crisis (SBP &gt; 180 or DBP &=
gt; 120), confirmed DM with active organ complication screening gap, or sig=
nificant liver enzyme elevation (ALT &gt; 3=C3=97 ULN) with NAFLD/alcohol/h=
igh-TG indicator</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"41c8baf2-ebe6-41d4-8012-bc124ff6d641">
<td data-local-id=3D"864e81cb-97a6-4d59-a865-efe816776fcb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9217b22314f1">2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ca2b89c-4d3f-471b-b498-c90f469c5349" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5e32eb4938c5"><code>PREMIUM_MULTI_SIGNAL</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"928ea2cc-fb38-47d5-a744-59a02bde46c3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7965a0a0de34">Premium</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"abb6543f-45b7-4a54-9f56-f67058837c50" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c45740fc306c">Cumulative signal burden</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9f405e4c-0a04-4777-a8c3-891323df84fb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cbd243dc60ea">=E2=89=A5 5 of 12 moderate-to-high-risk signal=
s simultaneously active (e.g. prediabetes, HTN, dyslipidaemia, BMI obese by=
 Asian threshold, intermediate ASCVD, stage 2 HTN, family history of premat=
ure CAD, at-risk alcohol use, fibroscan indication, lung CT eligibility, CK=
D, hyperuricaemia)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"17a23b2f-5f71-4f47-a499-744e48ee5148">
<td data-local-id=3D"6f926562-0fb2-41f0-9642-3e1bf647027a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2d0c70c8176b">3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"99a4e1e3-e41f-4269-8e41-fecc38010cf7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14a56dcfb44d"><code>ADVANCED_METABOLIC_OR_CVD</code></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"b8925df4-7e2e-4165-9462-21a0eeb113de" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5c100918a45f">Advanced</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1341403f-1875-484c-8444-9225aa952193" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a49613749a62">Single metabolic/CVD signal or moderate co-occ=
urring burden</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f9bdc7f4-87f3-4ff3-89a1-4e45bf3bf6a1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7025fb54d228">Prediabetes or diabetes confirmation pending, =
intermediate ASCVD (7.5=E2=80=9319.9% 10-yr risk), Stage 1=E2=80=932 HTN wi=
th comorbidity, LDCT eligibility, CKD (any stage), BMI =E2=89=A5 27.5 kg/m=
=C2=B2 (Asian threshold), or =E2=89=A5 2 of 14 moderate-risk indicators</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"eecf67eb-7d38-4b6d-a168-1e6b8f105e12">
<td data-local-id=3D"a7142c74-8ac7-4d99-868b-512ba0480e6c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"982ea6f017f3">4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f04ec0c8-b7d1-4780-a86f-4abd9e02e3c7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a4ec3d178ed9"><code>STANDARD_DEFAULT</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"32001ddf-2b44-47af-9acd-c21f7dfb9b4b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14285a381d26">Standard</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4aa0dfff-ea7e-44be-9b19-86a5267a8f11" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f964a61a6a7d">Default fallback</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b332db67-13bb-4c87-b8d8-a754f786fdce" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b1e2902f79c">No elevated-risk signals present; routine annu=
al preventive screening</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"54c0b1f731a6">In addition to the signals enumerated in the t=
ier rules above, the recommendation engine consumes four extended signal ca=
tegories. All signals below are pre-computed by the Data Platform and arriv=
e via <code>get_clinical_signals</code> (<code>risk_flags[]</code> and <cod=
e>symptom_triggers[]</code>):</p>
