<h3 local-id=3D"b3d73c60d755" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-7.3.2Add-OnPriorityLevels">7.3.2 Add-On Priority Level=
s</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ccf21af10cd7">Each recommended add-on item carries a priorit=
y designation that drives the clinical UI's display order and urgency signa=
ling.</p>
