<h4 local-id=3D"3f6707310b99" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-ConfigurationModel">Configuration Model</h4>
<p local-id=3D"308eb5430581">The active model is selected by setting a sing=
le environment variable at deployment time. The fallback chain =E2=80=94 th=
e ordered list of candidates the gateway will try if the primary model fail=
s =E2=80=94 is also declared in configuration, not in code.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cf179e854fb8">This means the same application build can serv=
e different model configurations across environments: a lightweight open-so=
urce model for development and testing, a proprietary cloud model for produ=
ction, or a fully air-gapped on-premise model for a data-sovereign deployme=
nt =E2=80=94 all without branching the codebase.</p>
