<h1 local-id=3D"50c82b97f4a9" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-8.Frontend&amp;Dashboards(UserExperience)"><strong>8. =
Frontend &amp; Dashboards (User Experience)</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"9eac65d2e973">The frontend of the Smart Health Checkup Recom=
mendation Dashboard is designed as a modern, containerized <strong>Single-P=
age Application (SPA)</strong> built entirely on the <strong>React</strong>=
 ecosystem. This section defines the technology stack, the high-level compo=
nent architecture mapping every TOR deliverable (=C2=A73.3 and =C2=A73.4) t=
o a concrete UI module, and the containerization strategy that ensures the =
frontend can be independently deployed, scaled, and swapped alongside all o=
ther microservices.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"1157ddafe371" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-8.1ResponsiveWebApplicationArchitecture">8.1 Responsiv=
e Web Application Architecture</h2>
