ommendationDashboard-8.1.2High-LevelComponentArchitecture">8.1.2 High-Level=
 Component Architecture</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a39c6f6b9c56">The following diagram maps every TOR-required =
screen (=C2=A73.3 items 1=E2=80=935, =C2=A73.4 items 1=E2=80=936) to a conc=
rete React module within the application. The SPA is split into two role-ga=
ted areas: the <strong>Healthcare Provider Portal</strong> and the <strong>=
Admin / DPO Portal</strong>.</p>
