<h3 local-id=3D"2ce982fd9056" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-8.1.3Component-to-TORRequirementMapping">8.1.3 Compone=
nt-to-TOR Requirement Mapping</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a7312e13ccda">Each React module directly addresses a specifi=
c TOR deliverable. The table below provides a precise mapping and highlight=
s the key UI behaviors expected:</p>
<p local-id=3D"fe64855f494d"><strong>Healthcare Provider Portal (TOR =C2=A7=
3.3)</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1184" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
