<tr data-local-id=3D"8cafb3a1-4220-441e-a62d-caf1708edb31">
<td data-local-id=3D"b03b4839-2d42-4649-992c-1cf0810ad7f8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e4a7a3dc2d8">=C2=A73.3 item 1</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ffe0c60a-0bcf-4512-a779-008da79e6874" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ac650b07cbf"><strong>Individual Summary &amp; Recommendatio=
n</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"86c06cf9-f8f8-4465-9b25-e66998f295f4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bda6264c06dd">Displays <code>Recommended Program</code>, <co=
de>Add-on List</code>, <code>Reasoning</code> (Explainable AI narrative), <=
code>Priority Level</code> (color-coded: Red / Yellow / Green), and <code>C=
onfidence Score</code> (percentage bar). Uses React Query's <code>useQuery<=
/code> to fetch AI recommendations asynchronously, rendering a skeleton/loa=
ding state to satisfy the non-blocking UI requirement (TOR =C2=A76.3).</p><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"34856270-567f-4308-a37d-eb578a23874c">
<td data-local-id=3D"ecbbdbfe-6afa-47fb-afa4-323fe0009d7d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3a439c7cf18b">=C2=A73.3 item 2</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8ff21a50-dfa0-4cbb-b4b5-cea080b9f342" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fcea8f02b636"><strong>Patient High Alert</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d7a4a803-c02f-4667-adc2-bba87f0c1115" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e8bbf3d74ef0">A prominently positioned alert panel showing a=
bnormal values affecting program selection, alarming lab values at alert le=
vels, and incomplete/missing records (Dead Record / Missing Critical Data).=
 Rendered as dismissible alert cards with severity badges.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"947a3042-9906-4ec2-af48-6d945e79ea2e">
<td data-local-id=3D"6a290745-efa6-44e5-8353-f4ba87c4d413" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3c218435caff">=C2=A73.3 item 3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1a51414f-296b-4218-a951-b1d4be068a14" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9055d2876718"><strong>Trend &amp; Timeline</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"93459ebf-0978-4a27-8bb9-e242a92e3e43" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f8f9085d9d93">Interactive multi-series line charts (Recharts=
/ECharts) showing 3=E2=80=935 years of longitudinal health data (BMI veloci=
ty, eGFR slope, lab value trends). A synchronized event timeline below the =
chart marks significant events (abnormal values, hospital admissions, diagn=
osis dates). Users can zoom, pan, and hover for detail tooltips.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"563f1b56-5884-4736-86be-cc5ce8529c37">
<td data-local-id=3D"d67af977-6777-478b-81ba-8e74df112d95" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ca7b550a9361">=C2=A73.3 item 4</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c409f4d0-c9b3-45dc-881f-68e2cfcbf432" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f883e01ed374"><strong>Screening Gap / Overdue List</strong><=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9aaa63a7-049d-4d32-b728-009577a1a2c6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b7a787ae2c0">A prioritized table of examinations that are d=
ue or overdue, with <code>Overdue Score</code> driving the sort order. Each=
 row displays the screening type, last examination date, days overdue, and =
a color-coded urgency indicator (Red =3D urgent, Yellow =3D approaching). I=
ncludes vaccination status tracking (Influenza, Hepatitis B, HPV, Pneumococ=
cal).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f426b102-0cdc-45b4-a3e9-27a118852454">
<td data-local-id=3D"a28d35b4-a71f-4911-bf8c-7d8cdf583d92" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"48b3fc43e909">=C2=A73.3 item 5</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bc386a68-4972-47ff-b6f3-03bb0d9bcdca" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12f152e73874"><strong>User Script (Communication Guide)</str=
ong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1aeb69d3-3db2-4fbc-ac02-d83ee07257d1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e16486417555">A collapsible panel providing standardized phy=
sician-to-patient communication scripts. Scripts are dynamically generated =
based on the active recommendation, ensuring explanations remain consistent=
 with hospital standards. Supports copy-to-clipboard and print functionalit=
y.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
