<h3 local-id=3D"a05b1c78b029" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-8.1.4MappingToolUI=E2=80=94ClinicalCodeManagement(TOR=
=C2=A73.4.5)">8.1.4 Mapping Tool UI =E2=80=94 Clinical Code Management (TOR=
 =C2=A73.4.5)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3b77ddb02072">The TOR explicitly requires a UI-based tool th=
at allows authorized staff to manage clinical code mappings <strong>without=
 requiring developer support</strong>. This is a critical administrative co=
mponent that bridges the gap between Navavej's local HIS codes and the inte=
rnational standards (LOINC, SNOMED CT, ICD-10) used by the FHIR database an=
d Data processing pipeline.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrap=
per image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"nvv-web-code-mapping-tool.jpeg"=
