<p local-id=3D"c473efd821f5"><strong>Core Capabilities:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1179" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"458e2186-d83d-4e95-9360-0cf1e9db12c1" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 376.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 802.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"58f9fdfe-a8dc-41b4-8ca5-8be4e5683405">
<th data-local-id=3D"d4080560-b4c0-4088-8512-15fc5c31f99c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a3ca33a688a3">Feature</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"94b36794-25f4-4e2b-890f-492d8e0a1415" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d896c0a3c55e">Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6b494ba1-0033-4bd8-b772-ce6775f12947">
<td data-local-id=3D"afb2e39e-d2bc-4ddc-b907-d62f35aa8b4a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1dc4f43187ad"><strong>Multi-Domain Mapping</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e8e0ef4b-f16b-4703-a183-c90d061d403f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"983d391cafb1">Supports four mapping categories: Lab codes (=
=E2=86=92 LOINC), Diagnosis codes (=E2=86=92 SNOMED CT / ICD-10), Procedure=
 codes (=E2=86=92 SNOMED CT), and Health Checkup Package codes (=E2=86=92 i=
nternal FHIR Code).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"766ac15b-538f-4a83-8437-26180b4c5053">
<td data-local-id=3D"59a69a33-f653-4823-909c-9a0c86f81826" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8fe022e7e646"><strong>Autocomplete with Standard Code Lookup=
</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3aad92f7-9c21-450b-bf4a-720ed515604a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"27794e7edabb">When creating or editing a mapping, the editor=
 provides an autocomplete search against the LOINC, SNOMED CT, and ICD-10 r=
eference databases, showing the official code, display name, and descriptio=
n. This prevents incorrect mappings.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1bce8640-d3bd-4a20-a4c8-2ff9c8ed8095">
<td data-local-id=3D"b4a8ed61-367f-4a77-9aca-43ca4322046b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44d1b2eecd64"><strong>Maker-Checker Approval Workflow</stron=
g></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4650e953-8da1-4cbc-847e-785320f75bbf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"feed7f8f6064">To prevent accidental or unauthorized changes =
to production mappings, all modifications follow a two-step workflow: one a=
uthorized user creates/edits the mapping (Maker), and a second authorized u=
ser reviews and approves it (Checker) before it takes effect.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fed9dd7c-3197-4ecb-af3d-8b6bbfe33325">
<td data-local-id=3D"e7b030bc-6a22-4f64-a7a2-3b51e84d55a3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d0221094e3b8"><strong>Bulk Import / Export</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a179478b-d416-4437-b4da-aceb820e564f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"75a2c566f69b">Authorized staff can upload CSV/Excel files fo=
r bulk mapping updates (e.g., when onboarding a new lab panel) and export t=
he current mapping table for offline review.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0a8811cb-6d22-4be9-b095-ce7c20e6f06b">
<td data-local-id=3D"d4d7db05-dc7f-44e2-b8ea-7889ce943210" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"06b3fe3f5438"><strong>Version History &amp; Rollback</strong=
></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"27cf32f6-3632-481e-a535-5773fd4cd8a2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"78f77378799c">Every mapping change is version-tracked. Admin=
istrators can view the full change history of any mapping entry and roll ba=
ck to a previous version if needed.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6e6dde98-5961-493c-b936-884c622d5a6e">
<td data-local-id=3D"88d2e196-091b-4f36-b692-bb1ddb21d012" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fde1f69584a8"><strong>Audit Trail Integration</strong></p></=
td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ae42398b-0dd5-4162-a9d2-dea3ab6a4f17" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37348263178e">All mapping actions (create, edit, approve, ro=
llback) are recorded in the 5-Dimension Audit Log (Who, When, Where, What, =
Why) for PDPA compliance.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"c94f84e9284b"><strong>Access Control:</strong> Only users wi=
th the <code>mapping_admin</code> role (assigned via the Role &amp; Permiss=
ion Management screen, =C2=A73.4.4) can access the Mapping Tool. View-only =
access is available for clinical staff who need to verify mappings but shou=
ld not modify them.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"b2815496d319" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-8.1.5Containerization&amp;Deployment(TOR=C2=A74.3)">8.=
1.5 Containerization &amp; Deployment (TOR =C2=A74.3)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"738e0676dae4">Per TOR =C2=A74.3, all services=E2=80=94includ=
ing the frontend=E2=80=94must run as independent Docker containers to facil=
itate convenient plug/unplug operations. The React SPA is packaged using a =
<strong>multi-stage Docker build</strong> to produce a minimal, production-=
optimized image:</p>
<div>
We don't have a way to export this macro.
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-1934475429" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1934475429" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"12d6790ad24896d77c6798d608975ef510283c=
c49b55e6f0ab90f21b044efffb" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">mermaid</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1934475429" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">flowcha=
rt LR
    subgraph Build_Stage ["Stage 1: Build (node:20-alpine)"]
        Src["Source Code&lt;br&gt;(TypeScript + React)"] --&gt; Vite["Vite =
Build&lt;br&gt;(npm run build)"]
        Vite --&gt; Dist["Static Assets&lt;br&gt;(/dist)"]
    end

    subgraph Production_Stage ["Stage 2: Serve (nginx:alpine)"]
        Dist --&gt; Nginx["Nginx&lt;br&gt;Serves /dist"]
        Config["nginx.conf&lt;br&gt;=E2=80=A2 SPA fallback routing&lt;br&gt=
;=E2=80=A2 gzip / brotli compression&lt;br&gt;=E2=80=A2 Security headers (C=
SP, HSTS)&lt;br&gt;=E2=80=A2 Health check endpoint"]
        Config --&gt; Nginx
    end

    Nginx --&gt; CDN["Optional: CloudFront CDN&lt;br&gt;for static asset ca=
ching"]</pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"858f130b4a21"><strong>Dockerfile Strategy (Multi-Stage Build=
)</strong></p>
