<p local-id=3D"7729b9b0a9a1"><strong>Key Nginx Configuration Points</strong=
></p>
<ul local-id=3D"01e58e6f-ea0b-4b6f-a035-1223c72a7eaf">
<li local-id=3D"b5de963c-1e37-4e82-a888-bc45d2ee2c31">
<p local-id=3D"65fea00eed37"><strong>SPA Fallback Routing:</strong> All rou=
tes fall back to <code>index.html</code> so React Router handles client-sid=
e navigation.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4fe2c65c-dcf3-47b0-91ca-a8a9d484f826">
<p local-id=3D"55b5c7ea8d90"><strong>Security Headers:</strong> Content Sec=
urity Policy (CSP), HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS), X-Content-Type-O=
ptions, and X-Frame-Options are set at the Nginx level.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a781ae94-4cd5-4c91-923f-377f86aee04d">
<p local-id=3D"629c59250405"><strong>Compression:</strong> Gzip and Brotli =
pre-compression of JS/CSS bundles for fast initial load.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"72fe01d8-752f-4f5d-8279-efc53ec533e8">
<p local-id=3D"bff43ccbc45f"><strong>Health Check Endpoint:</strong> Nginx =
exposes a <code>/health</code> endpoint returning HTTP 200, enabling Kubern=
etes/ECS readiness and liveness probes.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6bfea56-8b31-4669-a45e-3688e8dccecd">
<p local-id=3D"f66474b2ac90"><strong>Runtime Configuration Injection:</stro=
ng> Environment-specific variables (API base URL, SMART on FHIR endpoints, =
feature flags) are injected at container startup via an <code>env.js</code>=
 file generated by the entrypoint script =E2=80=94 not baked into the build=
. This allows the same Docker image to be deployed across development, stag=
ing, and production environments.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d10ec539dba2"><strong>Container Orchestration Context</stron=
g></p>
<p local-id=3D"ed99d77e4ec9">The Frontend container is one of several indep=
endently deployable services in the Docker Compose / Kubernetes cluster:</p=
>
