<p local-id=3D"d14bb5fc7e87">Access to the BI dashboards is role-gated via =
the existing RBAC framework (=C2=A78.1.3, TOR =C2=A73.4.4). Management user=
s see aggregated, anonymized metrics only =E2=80=94 no access to individual=
 patient records.</p>
