<h3 local-id=3D"beaaec139af9" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-8.2.3RejectionReasonCapture">8.2.3 Rejection Reason Ca=
pture</h3>
<p local-id=3D"fbe5957cc0ad">When a patient declines a recommended item, th=
e <strong>Healthcare Provider</strong> captures the reason through a simple=
 dropdown UI integrated directly into the Provider Portal. This is part of =
the same consultation workflow =E2=80=94 after presenting the AI-recommende=
d checkup plan, the provider records the patient's decision and, if refused=
, the reason.</p>
