<blockquote local-id=3D"cdc39d7f-1ec6-4ff2-83de-9ca475c4d9a0">
<p local-id=3D"31538500301a"><strong>AI Feedback Loop (TOR =C2=A77):</stron=
g> Rejection reasons are stored as structured data and fed back into the AI=
 tuning pipeline. Patterns such as "Item X is rejected 60% of the time due =
to cost" inform prompt adjustments =E2=80=94 for example, the AI may learn =
to prioritize cost-effective alternatives or flag high-cost add-ons with a =
note for the provider.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 local-id=3D"c73dabcfa368" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-8.2.4ExternalBilling/CRMIntegration">8.2.4 External Bi=
lling / CRM Integration</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f955e70227f6"><strong>Assumption:</strong> The specific bill=
ing or CRM system to integrate with is <strong>TBD - to be confirmed by Nav=
avej Hospital</strong>. The architecture is designed to support any system =
that can expose transaction data via API or database-level synchronization.=
</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"998" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"1ddcc6c5-df56-4376-8f5c-b9919f3f1224" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 207.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 790.0px;">
