nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"529130a0134c">Match by <code>patient_id</code> + <code>exami=
nation_code</code> + <code>date_range</code> (recommendation date =E2=86=92=
 transaction date within configurable window, e.g., 30 days)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"34acd596-a73a-4458-acdd-de058ea30842">
