<td data-local-id=3D"f6aecd2d-3c15-4e3d-9432-1085078316c0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c4d376582523">Listed as optional integration in Phase 2 deli=
very. Core BI dashboards (adoption rate, rejection reasons) function withou=
t billing integration; conversion rate requires it.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
