<p local-id=3D"afdbe1110366"></p>
<p local-id=3D"91293cf31417"><strong>Security Hardening</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"963" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"53fd654d-2cc0-45e4-a2a6-885176aacb1e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 243.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 719.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8a2a56db-6261-44d3-b0fd-69a7aef6b4e6">
<th data-local-id=3D"bf3256f6-8d61-4ab6-8b0a-b28246f89ecf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6d3298319eb1">Layer</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"5d6df742-c465-44bd-b321-cf9aeb111d7d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f968b7d21ca4">Implementation</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5f0a1578-a0f0-492b-8e9e-8ee5d0c084c1">
<td data-local-id=3D"f93c83fd-150f-47dc-8476-bddee51dbb7e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"75abf2656ade"><strong>TLS Termination</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ecde7aa6-1794-4847-908e-10d3dcc0d742" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f2b72bf0a7d6">Nginx handles TLS 1.2/1.3 with hospital-issued=
 certificates. All internal traffic between containers uses Docker's privat=
e network (not exposed to LAN).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fa7e553d-2548-41f1-89a6-0935a547864c">
<td data-local-id=3D"7e6c8dc5-6eed-4a70-adb8-539b88ce369c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ccc46e73c763"><strong>Firewall Rules</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bf61fd75-604c-4cf0-8d7f-1ba274c8a081" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a1114eaf461">Only port 443 (HTTPS) is open inbound from the=
 hospital LAN. Port 5432=E2=80=935434 (databases) are never exposed outside=
 the Docker network.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5396ce86-affc-48ed-a475-0dee1fc02028">
<td data-local-id=3D"d0ad02b4-5890-4f6e-a6e7-4360d76e5b23" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fc44a804144a"><strong>Docker Secrets</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ff560f85-0dee-44cd-8b17-d04080eb364e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1cffcfc1926c">Database passwords, API keys (OpenAI/Anthropic=
), and JWT signing keys are stored in Docker Secrets =E2=80=94 never in env=
ironment variables or <code>docker-compose.yml</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9cbae408-aa2f-41b4-b834-36061c0700e6">
<td data-local-id=3D"39da4211-0349-4ed4-a300-478b3c522375" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4f75d9229cf8"><strong>Read-Only Filesystems</strong></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"005a1dff-f581-4d60-aa8a-a56ab81e6476" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6438a16aa9d3">Application containers (<code>frontend</code>,=
 <code>mcp-server</code>) run with <code>read_only: true</code> Docker flag=
 to prevent runtime file system tampering.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5a4a6b46-ce48-4503-886d-443d8a4a2daa">
<td data-local-id=3D"adf1261a-2c9a-4135-92f0-dcad6f39e7c3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b262220bbfeb"><strong>Non-Root Containers</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9cc0615d-50a2-4f39-81f8-d9bd280b3f33" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7748d7a95ae7">All application containers run as non-root use=
rs (<code>USER 1000</code>). Database containers use the official PostgreSQ=
L non-root configuration.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"19b0a118-27fb-4243-9e1c-1015900be416">
<td data-local-id=3D"5ac2b124-05c7-4c67-9e4e-7e6a6c8dd161" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2aece35c3760"><strong>Network Isolation</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6b0b2a5e-50fe-4669-bdd2-15796a3ff44b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c181881de3e4">Two Docker networks are defined: <code>app-net=
</code> (application containers) and <code>db-net</code> (database containe=
rs). Only <code>backend-api</code>, <code>mcp-server</code>, and <code>auth=
-server</code> are attached to both. The <code>frontend</code> and <code>ai=
-gateway</code> cannot reach databases directly.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"34460b0c2e64" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-9.2Observability&amp;Monitoring(OSSStack)">9.2 Observa=
bility &amp; Monitoring (OSS Stack)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"090c402f8a3e">The system uses an entirely open-source observ=
ability stack built on <strong>OpenTelemetry</strong>, <strong>Prometheus</=
strong>, <strong>Grafana</strong>, and <strong>Loki</strong> =E2=80=94 repl=
acing any cloud-native dependencies (e.g., CloudWatch) to align with the on=
-premise strategy.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"42267a7c583a" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-9.2.1ThreePillarsofObservability">9.2.1 Three Pillars =
of Observability</h3>
<div>
We don't have a way to export this macro.
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-1953001922" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1953001922" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"12d6790ad24896d77c6798d608975ef510283c=
c49b55e6f0ab90f21b044efffb" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">mermaid</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1953001922" class=3D"expand-content">
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">flowcha=
rt LR
    subgraph Applications ["Application Containers"]
        API["backend-api"]
        MCP["mcp-server"]
        AIGw["ai-gateway"]
        Auth["auth-server"]
    end

    OTel["=F0=9F=94=AD OpenTelemetry Collector"]
   =20
    API --&gt;|Traces + Metrics + Logs| OTel
    MCP --&gt;|Traces + Metrics + Logs| OTel
    AIGw --&gt;|Traces + Metrics + Logs| OTel
    Auth --&gt;|Traces + Metrics + Logs| OTel

    Prom["=F0=9F=93=8A Prometheus&lt;br&gt;(Metrics Store)"]
    Loki["=F0=9F=93=9D Loki&lt;br&gt;(Log Store)"]
    Tempo["=F0=9F=94=97 Tempo&lt;br&gt;(Trace Store, optional)"]
    Grafana["=F0=9F=93=88 Grafana Dashboards"]

    OTel --&gt;|Metrics| Prom
    OTel --&gt;|Logs| Loki
    OTel --&gt;|Traces| Tempo

    Prom --&gt; Grafana
    Loki --&gt; Grafana
    Tempo --&gt; Grafana</pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
