nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de6ea8995097">Distributed traces across the full request cha=
in: Dashboard =E2=86=92 API =E2=86=92 MCP =E2=86=92 FHIR DB =E2=86=92 Centr=
al AI Gateway =E2=86=92 LLM. Identifies latency bottlenecks in the &lt; 10s=
 SLA budget.</p></td>
</tr>
