<h2 local-id=3D"88d09536df64" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-9.3DisasterRecovery(DR)&amp;BackupPlan">9.3 Disaster R=
ecovery (DR) &amp; Backup Plan</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"46e1d87a723a" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-9.3.1BackupStrategy">9.3.1 Backup Strategy</h3>
<p local-id=3D"19f5e63ecfb8">All persistent data is stored on Docker volume=
s mapped to the Database Server's RAID-10 storage. Backups follow a <strong=
>3-2-1 rule</strong> (3 copies, 2 different media, 1 offsite) using OSS too=
ling:</p>
