<blockquote local-id=3D"cb24e4ce-d4a9-48a9-b0fc-f79bbf77c07a">
<p local-id=3D"b039e578dc3d"><strong>Why existing patients may take longer:=
</strong> Existing patients have significantly larger clinical histories (3=
=E2=80=935 years of longitudinal data, lab trends, screening records). The =
MCP must fetch and assemble a larger masked context payload, and the AI mod=
el must process more input tokens to generate an accurate recommendation.</=
p>
</blockquote>
<h3 local-id=3D"4ee8fb5418e9" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-10.1.2LatencyBudgetBreakdown">10.1.2 Latency Budget Br=
eakdown</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4ffd019dc072">To ensure the SLA is achievable, the following=
 latency budget allocates time across each component in the critical path:<=
/p>
<div>
We don't have a way to export this macro.
</div>
