<h3 local-id=3D"3e88a1958f7c" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-10.1.3PerformanceTestingStrategy">10.1.3 Performance T=
esting Strategy</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1095" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"e01352bd-71b1-458a-976f-ae1825b5ac69" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 365.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 175.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 554.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d8d6916e-9eb9-48cb-9964-3008f4a30047">
<th data-local-id=3D"498ecdeb-68ce-4e6a-b98f-34e878b1b1f6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3ca3038738d2">Test Type</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"57b0535f-3fec-4310-bd30-53fab44ad260" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"24e556a668c7">Tool</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"0377a86a-9522-486c-9e06-62974bd8eebe" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3881c5afa90b">Methodology</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c79e87fe-2681-465d-9111-ed8939fc9718">
<td data-local-id=3D"c8c2295e-53ac-4e18-8761-a9a06128d684" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c83208d23c71"><strong>Load Testing</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"28670e66-15f3-416f-834e-d968965bf6ab" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9baecab3bf9">k6 (OSS) or Apache JMeter</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"de575946-217e-43f8-bb00-1ae69e46ece1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cbce81ae8d0b">Simulate 30 concurrent users each triggering 5=
 recommendation requests within 10 minutes. Measure p50, p95, p99 latency.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"28f95d9a-7571-4e61-a11f-131447dd02a2">
<td data-local-id=3D"b7686292-d4fa-4b64-8584-9c92f9a6f368" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef013fbad849"><strong>Stress Testing</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bb16dffc-d87a-4189-b716-5956adaf5626" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8451b2c5e978">k6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e0cb330b-9882-484f-99bb-38e991c464fd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d6a5f12f40e2">Gradually increase concurrent users from 30 =
=E2=86=92 60 =E2=86=92 100 to identify the breaking point and validate grac=
eful degradation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"52228177-ddb2-42c1-a2a5-b0d66547c7b3">
<td data-local-id=3D"f9db1abb-e8f8-4215-9ac2-502807d33221" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b00168dcb14f"><strong>Soak Testing</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6955d70b-25a6-4223-a871-56f9c1700498" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eac6d67ecc28">k6</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c691b24c-8043-4e37-88e4-e59b8b361511" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"818715105150">Run 30 concurrent users for 8 consecutive hour=
s to detect memory leaks, connection pool exhaustion, or degraded AI respon=
se times.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"08ae358e-fbab-4f81-9d2e-20754c95d3a7">
<td data-local-id=3D"b179a29a-cd26-4aad-a563-43bfa1a5f54d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2117f4453c57"><strong>AI Latency Profiling</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c649ff0e-c75c-46b7-acaf-d41cd3e262d7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0895bb992935">OpenTelemetry traces</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"19e028d1-1dc0-4dd8-9d28-4a6d37c93b71" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2d21c881294d">Instrument each component in the critical path=
 to identify bottlenecks. Dashboard available in Grafana (=C2=A78.2.2 =E2=
=80=94 AI Inference Monitor).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"01b94ccf8673"><strong>SLA Compliance Monitoring:</strong> Th=
e Grafana SLA Compliance dashboard (=C2=A79.2.2) continuously tracks the pe=
rcentage of requests completing within the defined SLA targets. Prometheus =
Alertmanager triggers a =F0=9F=94=B4 Critical alert if p95 latency exceeds =
10s for new patients or 30s for existing patients for 5 consecutive minutes=
.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"ae5c1b48d8ae" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-10.2Scalability&amp;HighAvailabilityMatrix">10.2 Scala=
bility &amp; High Availability Matrix</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1039" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"9e6da175-b698-4bb9-a79c-261abb5b500e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 231.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 373.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 433.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e4bfb5c8-b28b-4e28-95f4-237571a1ef03">
<th data-local-id=3D"de1199f8-a69a-4a26-89fa-141d8f83a521" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"328085fa063d">NFR Dimension</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"102caf09-f05c-48f8-a6e7-cca868af41a0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4d341b1c4444">Target</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"234bc815-04a0-4fd8-8e5b-c143f32ec203" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"849db0e55d69">How Achieved</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fa224a57-ddd0-4b6b-b8b5-ed1a4b3be87e">
<td data-local-id=3D"a28eb49a-9386-4251-9f81-87e73424b3e6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f749690b286b"><strong>Concurrent Users</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a462060c-c09a-4bb9-9a05-5980115b8733" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e990e9a4b95b">30 users at peak (Year 1)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"444441ea-53e2-44d7-9721-3c515d25f112" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d2bacc0035c">Single Application Server (16 vCPU, 32 GB) han=
dles all application containers.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"79132549-bfb1-45cf-b3bb-883a219b0a19">
<td data-local-id=3D"e8f4caec-f75d-47e1-a2f1-9298e4d10cfa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb74b01886f3"><strong>Horizontal Scaling</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"35225863-6075-4234-825d-233447fb2f9f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8a2134d83e12">Up to 100 users (Year 2=E2=80=933)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5186c6cb-90e1-430c-b0c8-be42767ca4e0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f2d9cabb784d">Migrate from Docker Compose to K3s (lightweigh=
t Kubernetes). Replicate <code>backend-api</code> and <code>mcp-server</cod=
e> behind a load balancer.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d74e587f-ee76-476a-9017-415b7b998770">
<td data-local-id=3D"6e45892c-41eb-45c3-8d2d-42c5a40bff8e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e4fc9a1925ab"><strong>Database Scaling</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2e7a0dc9-61e7-46c9-9dc3-aaf1cd867052" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"34caa8af4d8d">10,000 =E2=86=92 50,000 patients</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9865b862-88ee-484a-a643-7810f574aa85" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"95e66b8474fe">PostgreSQL connection pooling (PgBouncer), rea=
d replicas for the <code>masked_clinical_fhir</code> schema, and table part=
itioning by patient ID range.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"979725c6-9323-4b51-9fa8-513bb461c86b">
<td data-local-id=3D"25ea8263-3a73-4088-8e21-f6e83edd8a0a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4c5457fb4017"><strong>AI Throughput</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0d4dba0d-8a3c-402b-bfdc-3dca67fb907d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a419d73ca75b">900 prompts/day (Year 1) =E2=86=92 3,000+ (Yea=
r 3)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"03924fe8-97d8-4ff4-be0f-4e25cb47d2f3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14ccf61f3017">Central AI Gateway supports concurrent model c=
alls. Gemini 1.5 Pro API scales automatically. For higher throughput, enabl=
e request batching or add a second model endpoint.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cde9e626-5623-4ba1-bb07-23e80785a9ef">
<td data-local-id=3D"dc0e4885-e3d6-4761-bcbb-90608a59305a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fed48530b996"><strong>Availability Target</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b95e20e6-194c-4534-a8ae-7be1faa048db" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"573cbdce8906">99.5% uptime (business hours)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c90a147c-ed06-4881-9317-436756b3423a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ee2f4c8fa73">Docker <code>restart: always</code> for auto-r=
ecovery. Database on separate server (fault isolation). Grafana alerts for =
immediate incident detection.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c0230182-9a59-41ec-89b8-6b63280db8d1">
<td data-local-id=3D"642685a5-f70b-4820-a5d5-986661fada0d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8cf2f5b4b8c9"><strong>Data Storage Growth</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2dab6af1-3106-44c1-9fb1-5526fd97c089" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"db3976708e78">~12 GB Year 1 =E2=86=92 ~50 GB Year 3</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"377a556e-2552-4c43-9901-28620af704ef" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cadfd68de5fc">1 TB RAID-10 on DB server provides ~20=C3=97 h=
eadroom. Disk usage alerts at 80% (=C2=A78.2.3).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"3ec0e08e360c" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-10.3MedicalValidationStrategy(MedicalAcceptanceTest)">=
10.3 Medical Validation Strategy (Medical Acceptance Test)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"8da9318214af">The TOR (=C2=A76.2) mandates that the AI recom=
mendation engine must achieve <strong>accuracy comparable to medical expert=
s at &gt; 95%</strong>, validated through a structured blind test protocol.=
 This section defines the complete MAT framework.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"647390ee3b48" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-10.3.1BlindTestProtocol">10.3.1 Blind Test Protocol</h=
3>
<div>
We don't have a way to export this macro.
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-171710872" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-171710872" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"12d6790ad24896d77c6798d608975ef510283c=
c49b55e6f0ab90f21b044efffb" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">mermaid</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-171710872" class=3D"expand-content">
<p local-id=3D"22d8afa2dad8"></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">flowcha=
rt TD
    subgraph Setup ["Test Setup"]
        Cases["Select =E2=89=A5 100 diverse&lt;br&gt;patient cases from&lt;=
br&gt;historical records"]
        Panel["Assemble panel of&lt;br&gt;5 medical experts&lt;br&gt;(indep=
endent physicians)"]
    end

    subgraph Execution ["Parallel Blind Execution"]
        direction LR
        AI["=F0=9F=A4=96 AI System&lt;br&gt;generates recommendations&lt;br=
&gt;for each case"]
        Experts["=F0=9F=A7=91=E2=80=8D=E2=9A=95=EF=B8=8F Each expert&lt;br&=
gt;independently reviews&lt;br&gt;the same cases"]
    end

    subgraph Evaluation ["Consensus &amp; Scoring"]
        Consensus["Expert Consensus:&lt;br&gt;=E2=89=A5 3 of 5 experts agre=
e&lt;br&gt;=3D 'Gold Standard' answer"]
        Compare["Compare AI output&lt;br&gt;vs. Gold Standard"]
        Score["Calculate accuracy %&lt;br&gt;across all 100+ cases"]
    end

    Cases --&gt; Execution
    Panel --&gt; Execution
    AI --&gt; Consensus
    Experts --&gt; Consensus
    Consensus --&gt; Compare
    Compare --&gt; Score

    Score --&gt;|"=E2=89=A5 95%"| Pass["=E2=9C=85 MAT PASSED"]
    Score --&gt;|"&lt; 95%"| Fail["=E2=9D=8C Retrain / Adjust&lt;br&gt;Rule=
s &amp; Re-test"]</pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"813263337cda" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-10.3.2TestCaseDesign">10.3.2 Test Case Design</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1066" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"9f3ca2eb-940f-4a94-8870-efe094436ac0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 222.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 843.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"75c18979-6356-47fa-a6f0-38eae27fdc4c">
<th data-local-id=3D"33793425-75e2-442f-832c-3b6bebe52b04" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"77878713dd5b">Dimension</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"51e1044d-d907-409b-bd90-2aa127645a96" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5c647f9c78e7">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2327cd03-3a24-4795-a7a5-7cb1329e85a0">
<td data-local-id=3D"e7ce1649-9ec3-408a-9af8-b91f0ae8ee0d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"66219cbab5a4"><strong>Minimum Cases</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a517112b-7625-40ba-b957-f428de0565a5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3b794e93a04">=E2=89=A5 100 patient cases (per TOR =C2=A76.2=
)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6a35649a-6240-48eb-bf2b-2e4c094443ac">
<td data-local-id=3D"41aea9f3-22cd-499d-bacd-ca17daa9d5fc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"33751738a6b3"><strong>Diversity Coverage</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c8d37539-6081-4fe2-99dd-a195717b49ca" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9e01d4ea40a2">Cases must span: male/female, ages 20=E2=80=93=
80, low/moderate/high risk profiles, patients with comorbidities (DM, hyper=
tension), patients with genetic risk factors, patients with behavioral risk=
 factors (smoking, alcohol)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"053710ae-1f52-4b9c-bd5c-fe5a31484736">
<td data-local-id=3D"25395165-6955-4d38-bcb4-3c0d4377add6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"009c0b9d1805"><strong>Data Blinding</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6940ea9e-ecb1-44bb-b815-9943ed7defa5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b8a13687ed4">AI system and human experts receive identical =
de-identified clinical data. Neither party knows the other's recommendation=
s during evaluation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bf2900ec-623d-450f-9de8-0ad2b7114940">
<td data-local-id=3D"ebe375ae-25e8-415b-a74f-e5e8ca6dd912" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"748bf2ebffb3"><strong>Expert Panel</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7dc17b05-7c7f-4dc7-a994-b5cc43415e9f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d7ab5cb6d05e">5 independent physicians. Specialists should i=
nclude: internal medicine, preventive medicine, and at least one sub-specia=
list (cardiology, endocrinology, or oncology).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
