<h3 local-id=3D"1f43c83eccff" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-10.4.4Circuit-BreakerPattern">10.4.4 Circuit-Breaker P=
attern</h3>
<p local-id=3D"290c77d3b6f1">To prevent cascading failures when the externa=
l AI API (Gemini) is experiencing an outage, the Central AI Gateway impleme=
nts a <strong>circuit-breaker</strong>:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1105" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"dfdd70bd-9e4a-46d2-8a45-58040d5a7c91" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 236.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 295.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 572.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"90464b87-e337-495d-b4f8-9d3b10f8356e">
<th data-local-id=3D"c9547e26-0222-4d39-80ee-38d0a089ebf7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ed67366b41b8">State</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"55ef7d25-5e4f-452d-a02b-5f0089c14e64" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ea9d2f1f7450">Condition</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"49fa9071-b14c-42b5-849c-ad2a8f449560" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"73312598092d">Behavior</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"420a2416-3274-4643-8bca-fa8e61a16347">
<td data-local-id=3D"e8ba9177-f17b-43ca-8913-313459f776e3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"237b36a05c18"><strong>Closed</strong> (normal)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0cb70923-9a89-481c-9553-c8b9de63b20c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c8a8b117aec">Error rate &lt; 5%</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"74cfd97b-6270-43dc-9dc1-2ff2f986bc77" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eed4cfabaff5">All requests sent to Gemini normally</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a5d08427-f76d-422d-b789-45aa249db583">
<td data-local-id=3D"afd15c05-c3ad-484e-83ad-8c5ca41cf32a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"057e38b4305e"><strong>Open</strong> (tripped)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4e8c237a-91f4-4048-8e99-fc003bf78850" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"76eb860ae5cc">Error rate =E2=89=A5 5% over 5 minutes, or 3 c=
onsecutive timeouts</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3edc96e4-c4f1-4a94-beae-da8e0b1ba477" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b3bb9157cc9b">All requests immediately routed to rule-based =
fallback =E2=80=94 <strong>no calls to Gemini</strong>. Reduces latency fro=
m ~10s (waiting for timeout) to ~1s (instant rule-based response).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3b33fe1c-f22e-451e-8ac5-dcb17ad8d177">
<td data-local-id=3D"8eae1afe-b4e0-4224-bce3-8cc07780255a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"61d31fc77e43"><strong>Half-Open</strong> (probing)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"42a057a0-2a29-4535-8838-b3826526aa49" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da65ef380278">After 60 seconds in Open state</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f6a98a25-a985-4997-aa04-c708004ca785" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"345d08764ec6">Send 1 test request to Gemini. If successful =
=E2=86=92 return to Closed. If failed =E2=86=92 remain Open for another 60s=
.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"e80632ad4b71">This pattern ensures that when Gemini is down,=
 users still receive instant rule-based recommendations rather than experie=
ncing repeated 10-second timeouts. The circuit state is visible on the AI I=
nference Monitor Grafana dashboard (=C2=A79.2.2).</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"250c9cddc0bf" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-11.InfrastructureLicensing&amp;CloudCosts"><strong>11.=
 Infrastructure Licensing &amp; Cloud Costs</strong></h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"03d432ef6926" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-11.1WorkloadAssumptions">11.1 Workload Assumptions</h2=
>
<blockquote local-id=3D"06913aca-7640-48a8-9e00-c5612e7dea88">
<p local-id=3D"3ca972a944d2"><strong>Important:</strong> All cost estimates=
 in this section are calculated for the following specific workload profile=
. If the actual workload differs significantly (e.g., higher concurrency, m=
ore AI calls, or a larger patient base), infrastructure sizing and costs mu=
st be re-evaluated accordingly.</p>
</blockquote>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"952" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"d40b6bea-b632-436c-94b4-5b30fcca7637" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 264.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 687.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f60cdb7c-fc9e-4dd3-98a3-acaa494b9b27">
<th data-local-id=3D"beba234f-3f99-4ade-a8f8-8994c704e0f5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
