<blockquote local-id=3D"33046302-5ea0-4b42-b63f-08fb3bd3f3b6">
<p local-id=3D"74ad0d3371de"><strong>Note:</strong> At 900 prompts/day, AI =
API costs are a moderate but manageable expense (~$248/month). This cost sc=
ales linearly with user count =E2=80=94 if providers double to 60 users, AI=
 cost would approximately double to ~$496/month. Gemini 1.5 Pro's competiti=
ve token pricing keeps this significantly lower than equivalent models (e.g=
., Turbo at ~3=C3=97 this rate).</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 local-id=3D"4371ce793158" id=3D"TechnicalProposal-SmartHealthCheckupRec=
ommendationDashboard-11.4InfrastructureCostComparison:On-Premisevs.AWSCloud=
