<blockquote local-id=3D"d021f060-e598-4da2-9565-5610ad3a0514">
<p local-id=3D"62e1e26c1127"><strong>Note on AWS Cost Optimization:</strong=
> If Navavej commits to a <strong>1-year Reserved Instance</strong> plan (n=
o upfront), infra costs reduce by ~30%, bringing the monthly total to appro=
ximately <strong>~$430 =E2=80=93 $470/month</strong> (including AI API). A =
<strong>3-year RI</strong> commitment reduces infra costs by ~50%.</p>
</blockquote>
